{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790284406, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "IBM TechZone Runbook -- scripted reenactment"}
[0.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== IBM TechZone Runbook -- scripted reenactment of a live MCP run ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "This is a reenactment built from real commands/output captured\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "during a live run against a TechZone environment. Timings are\r\n"]
[0.6, "o", "compressed; long-running waits (install ~31m, deploy ~23m) are\r\n"]
[0.65, "o", "summarized rather than played out in full.\r\n"]
